// Into a fissure by its east mouth and out along the 24 m bridge to its broken middle, then stand there
// 10 s: the mouth's floor is the deck's top (no 0.5 m slot by the wall to step into), and every deck is
// keyed into both walls and its cords hang under decks, so nothing comes down on the mole.
map
